ents/2602492691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101831#issuecomment-2602492691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101831","id":2602492691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bHuMT","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T13:56:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T17:10:15Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/81060, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97750 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/61415.\n\nThis is likely an AMD Polaris-specific issue as this GPU generation has historically been problematic with MSAA in Godot + Vulkan.\n\nCan you try using the Direct3D 12 rendering driver in the Project Settings and see if this resolves the issue?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602492691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602508479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101831#issuecomment-2602508479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101831","id":2602508479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bHyC_","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T14:03:09Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T14:15:30Z","body":"No, this does not happen on Direct3D 12","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602508479/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617406870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101831#issuecomment-2617406870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101831","id":2617406870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cAnWW","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T01:20:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T01:20:33Z","body":"I agree this sounds like a driver issue, especially since it randomly went away and then re-appeared. \n\nIt looks like you are using a GPU driver from [February 2023](https://www.amd.com/en/resources/support-articles/release-notes/RN-RAD-WIN-23-2-1.html), so it is already two years old. The latest driver is from [March 2024](https://www.amd.com/en/resources/support-articles/release-notes/RN-RAD-WIN-24-3-1-POLARIS-VEGA.html). I recommend trying out the newest driver to see if it fixes the issue for you. I looked through subsequent release notes and found some references to blocky issues and issues with Vulkan that have been subsequently fixed for your GPU","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617406870/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2623563757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101831#issuecomment-2623563757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101831","id":2623563757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cYGft","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T05:40:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T06:15:26Z","body":"Yes my drivers are indeed 2023, I will update them and let you know if that fixed the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2623563757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2623596933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101831#issuecomment-2623596933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101831","id":2623596933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cYOmF","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id